    "body": "In John 16 Jesus says His disciples will weep while the world rejoices, but their sorrow will turn to joy, like a mother who forgets labor pains once her child is born. No one will take that joy away, and they will ask the Father in His name and receive, so their joy is full. The cross was meant to hurt briefly and bring lasting joy.",
