    "lang": "Greek",
    "claimed": "Rest is a noun, a place, not a verb.",
    "lexicon": "In Heb 3–4 katapausis is indeed a noun (resting place, rest), and Heb 4:11 urges diligence (spoudazō) to enter it. The point is broadly sound.",
    "verdict": "supported"
