    "body": "The series rejects the idea that Jesus was baptized because good Jews were baptized, and says Jews did not practise baptism. In the preacher’s account, John’s baptism was a search for the Messiah: John had been told the one on whom the dove landed was the One, so he immersed people until the sign came. This shows how ordinary Jesus’ humanity looked.",
