    "body": "Asked who has ever lived forever, the preacher answers Jesus. Hebrews 2 says God put all creation under humanity’s charge and left nothing outside it. We do not yet see that, but we see Jesus, who has won the victory for us. What He was given He gives to us, as Joshua’s land was given to Israel.",
