    "title": "A person in all three realms",
    "body": "The believer’s spirit is one spirit with the Lord and is unseen and uncreated. The soul occupies the second heaven, and the body, which is distinct from ‘flesh’ as a nature, is the first-heaven point of contact with earth. That makes the body the most important technology in creation. The preacher says God cannot do what a person can do, because only humans were given dominion on earth.",
