    "title": "Submission without hierarchy",
    "body": "The Creator stepped into a local body and asked what He could do, a picture of family. Jesus overcame familiarity by submitting to His cousin, not because of hierarchy but because both knew who the other was in the heavenlies.",
    "refs": []
